Connecting ZED to JETSON Instructions:
1. Make sure nothing is connected to power
2. Connect the Mono to the Jetson via the MIPI cable (Type B 22-pin, aka the blue stickers are on opposite sides of the cable)
3. Make sure that the blue side is facing up at the Jetson port and the Mono port (The cable should twist once)
4. Connect the mono to the ZED via the round cable
5. Connect battery power to the mono
6. Connect power to the Jetson and power on
